# The scenario editor on the first GDI mission, and its dialogs that erase a
# line of text before printing it again: the strip along the top, the map size
# dialog, whose box is dragged so that its coordinates change, and the team
# members dialog, which names the picture under the pointer.
# args: -EDITOR
at 200 shot editor
at 201 rclick 400 150
at 240 shot main_menu
at 241 key DOWN
at 245 key DOWN
at 249 key DOWN
at 259 key RETURN
at 300 shot size_map
at 301 press 217 121
at 310 move 200 110
at 320 move 190 100
at 330 shot size_map_dragging
at 331 release 190 100
at 360 shot size_map_moved
# Cancel goes back to the menu, with Size Map still chosen.
at 361 key ESC
at 401 key DOWN
at 405 key DOWN
at 409 key DOWN
at 419 key RETURN
at 460 shot ai_menu
# Edit Teams. The arrow keys do not move this menu's choice.
at 461 click 145 190
at 520 shot team_list
at 521 click 120 322
at 560 shot team_edit
at 561 click 147 365
at 600 shot team_members
at 601 move 260 100
at 640 shot member_chem_warrior
at 641 move 60 260
at 680 shot member_nod_buggy
at 681 move 320 20
at 720 shot member_none
at 721 quit
